# Needs the dev test stock (TST) in a test save. The one sectioned list in Economy → Investments:
# a purchase moves TST from All stocks into Your portfolio with its holding and gain, Buy on its
# row opens the game's dialog, and the stock at the top of the view stays there through the
# purchase. Selling the shares back moves it out again.
name investments list: a purchase moves the stock into Your portfolio and the list keeps its place
close-economy
investments-list on
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
remember TST
show-economy
wait 1.5
# from the top, whatever an earlier visit left
investments-scroll -100000
expect-investments All TST
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTBuy
wait 1
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 4
click Button
wait 1.5
expect-owned-delta TST 4
expect-investments Portfolio TST
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTHolding 4 sh · avg ₡100
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTSell
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsHeading-Portfolio
capture investments-list-tst-held
cleanup:
sell-back TST 4
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
investments-list restore
close-economy
